  click TRIG href "#sec-launch" "Everything that calls reevaluate: ContentView .task(id: notificationToken) at launch and on toggle changes, scene-active (sceneActive, or taskCompleted when the widget flag is set), the reevaluates after auto-plan and new copy, NudgeApp handleDailyRecalc at 6 AM, SessionCoordinator start / complete / end, TasksTabView, HomeTabView, CalendarTabView, DayPlanRefiner, NudgeCopyGenerator.noteShift. DEBUG only: EvalHarness, CaptureHistoryExporter and the -nudge-import-ical launch argument in ContentView." _self
  click LAUNCH href "#sec-launch" "Sets UNUserNotificationCenter.delegate, registers the 13 notification categories, registers and submits the com.deblaser.nudge.dailyRecalc background task." _self
  click IOS_BG href "#sec-launch" "Wakes handleDailyRecalc at or after 6 AM; permitted by Nudge/Info.plist." _self
  click ARB href "#sec-arbiter" "Single decision engine: debounce, cancelAll, master toggle, 10 builders, gates, pickWinners, schedule. Reads tasks, profile, outcomes and App Group histories; writes NudgeOutcome(.pending), scheduledIDs and the history maps; adds and removes requests; writes the Screen Time snapshot afterwards." _self
  click STORE href "#sec-builders" "SwiftData store: NudgeTask, UserProfile, NudgeOutcome, NudgeGoal, CompletedTaskRecord. The builder table shows who reads what." _self
  click GROUP href "#sec-keys" "App Group group.com.deblaser.nudge: scheduledIDs, five history maps, idleDismissed, lastFocusSessionStartedAt, widgetMutated, copy cache, tappedNudge keys, AppOpenLog, Screen Time settings, snapshot, rung keys, breadcrumbs." _self
  click COPY href "#sec-copy" "Copy is written ahead by Claude, cached in nudge.copy.cache, validated and placeholder-filled at scheduling time; any miss uses the builder's template." _self
  click UNC href "#sec-addsites" "The four add sites: NudgeArbiter.schedule, NudgeActivityMonitorExtension.post, rescheduleSnoozed, sendTestNotification." _self
  click NSVC href "#sec-delivery" "willPresent shows banner and sound; didReceive writes the outcome result, starts a session, re-adds a snoozed request, writes the idleDismissed and tappedNudge keys, and posts the tab to open. The foreground sweep records outcomes." _self
  click WIDGET href "#sec-launch" "Completing a task from the widget removes its pending arbiter requests, trims scheduledIDs and sets widgetMutated so the app reevaluates undebounced on its next foreground." _self
  click DMON href "#sec-screentime" "App side of Screen Time: authorization, daily and weekly schedules with the limit thresholds, and the snapshot the extension reads." _self
  click IOS_DA href "#sec-screentime" "Runs the NudgeActivityMonitor process when a threshold is crossed." _self
  click EXT href "#sec-screentime" "Reads settings, snapshot and rung keys from the App Group; writes rung keys and breadcrumbs; posts limit-ladder and mirror notifications with placeholder copy." _self
